For a given drive frequency,
\[
A(\omega)=\frac{F_0/m}{\sqrt{(\omega_0^2-\omega^2)^2+(b\omega/m)^2}}
\]
Since \(F_0/m\) is the same in both tests, it cancels in the ratio:
\[
\frac{A_a}{A_b}
=\frac{\sqrt{(\omega_0^2-\omega_b^2)^2+(b\omega_b/m)^2}}
{\sqrt{(\omega_0^2-\omega_a^2)^2+(b\omega_a/m)^2}}
\]
